    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>Equates centripetal force (with Newton’s law of gravitation <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mr \\omega^{2}=\\frac{GMm}{r^{2}}\"></span>) OR <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T=\\frac{2\\pi}{\\omega}\"></span> ✓<br/>Uses both equation correctly with clear re-arrangement ✓</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r_{De}^{3}=\\frac{T_{De}^{2}r_{Ph}^{3}}{T_{Ph}^{2}}\"></span> seen or correct substitution ✓ 23.5 Mm ✓</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c\"><p><strong>c</strong></p><p>Converts T to 27.6 ks and converts to m from Mm ✓  <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"k=7.33\\times 10^{-14}\"></span> «s<sup>2</sup> m<sup>−3</sup>» ✓  «<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M=\\frac{1}{kG}\"></span>» <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=2.04\\times 10^{23}\"></span> «kg» ✓    MP1 can be implicit</p></section>"
